"A goal, into the net under the bar, is worth 3 points. A point, over the bar, is worth 1. Add them up: the higher total wins.": "Is fiú trí phointe cúl, isteach sa líontán faoin trasnán. Is fiú pointe amháin pointe, thar an trasnán. Cuir le chéile iad: buann an t-iomlán is airde.",
"From 1892 to 1895 a goal was worth 5 points; it has been worth 3 since 1896. A point, over the bar, is worth 1.": "Ó 1892 go 1895 b'fhiú cúig phointe cúl; is fiú trí phointe é ó 1896 i leith. Is fiú pointe amháin pointe, thar an trasnán.",
